loader":{"login":"muthumanikandanb2005-ux","id":226152175,"node_id":"U_kgDODXrO7w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226152175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux","html_url":"https://github.com/muthumanikandanb2005-ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":676,"digest":"sha256:eac12f3698e05e68b1831cee3d5a09615fc82590fb3a8d6541450911daabdcd1","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-21T11:27:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T11:27:44Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/releases/download/v3.2.0/SHA256SUMS.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/tarball/v3.2.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/zipball/v3.2.0","body":"## Pulse Music v3.2.0 (High-Performance OTA Update)\n\n### ≡ƒÜÇ Zero Startup Freeze & Complete Supabase Removal\n- Completely eliminated Supabase authentication, account sign-in/up dialogs, and detached background sync coroutines.\n- The app now operates 100% offline with zero network blocking on launch, immune to server outages, timeouts, and multi-user concurrency bottlenecks.\n\n### ΓÜí Instant Single-Tap Search Playback\n- Resolved the marquee touch focus bug that intercepted the first touch event on search results and suggestions.\n- Keyboard and search bar focus are now cleared immediately upon query delivery, allowing single-tap song playback.\n\n### ≡ƒÆ¿ 2x Blazing Fast Update Downloads\n- The update engine automatically resolves and prioritizes the device's native architecture (`arm64-v8a`), cutting download payload by ~50% (33MB vs 61MB).\n- Upgraded the update stream I/O buffer to 256KB with 200ms progress throttling for maximum TCP throughput without UI stutter.\n\n### ≡ƒîè 60/120fps Smoothness & System Refinity\n- Transformed `MiniPlayer` with a hardware Canvas-rendered `MiniLiveEqualizer` to eliminate layout re-measuring overhead.\n- Isolated crossfading transitions and lyric state observing with `derivedStateOf`, eliminating continuous recompositions.\n- Wrapped low-level cursor window reflection in safe fault-tolerant handlers, preventing OEM-specific startup crashes.\n"}